  <mtmd:FulfillmentPhase>
    <mtmd:DecideModelingObjectiveFulfillment id="sig-ce74216e6758"><stc:Input><stc:ResourceReference xlink:href="#id_tc_dssqv_out"/></stc:Input><stc:Procedure><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_tc_fulfill_proc"><stc:Content>Compared the approved, integrated model against the modelling objective from AnalyzeModelingTaskAndObjectives, in coordination with the higher-level Credible Simulation Process (SimulationTask.stmd).</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Procedure><stc:Output><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_tc_fulfill_out"><stc:Content>Modelling objective fulfilled: the AgressiveRegeneration variant is implemented, respects AUTOSAR torque-arbitration constraints, and is confirmed ready for the task-level range-comparison runs.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Output><stc:Rationale><stc:Resource kind="document" type="text/markdown" id="id_tc_fulfill_rat"><stc:Content>This model's change is the direct mechanism behind the task's primary KPI (range gain from more aggressive regen blending), so its own fulfillment decision is the one most tightly coupled to the parent task's outcome.</stc:Content></stc:Resource></stc:Rationale><stc:LifeCycleInformation><stc:Approved date="2026-07-02T15:00:00Z"><stc:Responsible organization="MBI LLC - Vehicle Energy Systems CAE" role="Simulation Engineer" name="T. Okafor"/><ssc:Signature role="authenticity" type="application/xml"><ssc:Content><ds:Signature xmlns:ds="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#" xmlns:xades="http://uri.etsi.org/01903/v1.3.2#" Id="SignXMLSignatureF1EF5985"><ds:SignedInfo><ds:CanonicalizationMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2006/12/xml-c14n11"/><ds:SignatureMethod Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2001/04/xmldsig-more#rsa-sha256"/><ds:Reference URI="#sig-ce74216e6758" Id="SignXMLReference44E83D33"><ds:Transforms><ds:Transform Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2000/09/xmldsig#enveloped-signature"/><ds:Transform Algorithm="http://www.w3.org/2006/12/xml-c14n11"/></ds:Transforms>